Adapted upstream code (flyhash-agent-memory @ tag v1.0, commit
ba836793f40b1ff9ab827395c7d1f55631406d6b):

  https://github.com/mohanji/flyhash-agent-memory

Sources used in this experiment folder:

  - src/flyhash.py          → flyhash.py (FlyHash, SimHash classes)
  - src/recall_vs_bits.py   → flyhash.py (vectorized_hamming_ranking)

Paper reference: Bheemadolu & Odhiambo (2026), arXiv:2611.05791;
FlyHash mechanism: Dasgupta, Stevens & Navlakha (2017), Science.

This playground experiment folder is Team OS research scaffolding only;
it is not the upstream project and does not vend the full upstream repo.

